---
title: Clever Dripper by James Hoffmann
source: https://honestcoffeeguide.com/brew-recipes/james-hoffmann-clever-dripper/
filter: paper
---

@Clever 15g 250g 90°C
grind medium-fine

/rinse
0:00 250g -- the water goes in first, before the coffee
0:00 /stir -- add the coffee, stir until all the grounds are wet
2:00 /stir -- break the crust
2:22 /open -- set the Clever on the cup

target 4:00
